<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs off $1.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs off $1.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were mostly $1.50 lower. Demand light on light offerings. Top $59.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>- USDA</p>
<p>US 1-2 230-260 lbs. 58.00-59.50</p>
<p>Sows: Unevenly steady to weak under 500 lbs., steady to firm</p>
<p>over 500 lbs. Top 55.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-400 lbs. 45.00-48.00</p>
<p>	 400-500 lbs. 48.00-50.00</p>
<p>	 500-600 lbs. 50.00-53.00</p>
<p>few over 600 lbs. 52.00-54.00, few 55.00</p>
</text>
